      "content": "In our grant we promised reviewers a network-informed analysis of our 180 ovarian tumour somatic mutation profiles. We have the tumour-by-gene mutation table, gene exon lengths, a cancer gene list and a Reactome GMT file. Now I need to figure out what to deliver."
